        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;page-as-data — read the screen as data, not as a screenshot&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#605E5C&quot;&gt;How a developer or an AI coding agent checks a web page while fixing a bug · zero dependencies · Chrome DevTools Protocol&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=10;fontColor=#323130;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#323130;" vertex="1" parent="1">
